    "details": {
      "alignment": "Lawful Neutral",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "human"
      },
      "cr": 6,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>The Regal Lion packet sheet \u2014 Commander Byscilla Danos.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/regal-lion.json</code> (entry <code>byscilla-danos</code>): Medium humanoid (human), Lawful Neutral; CR 6 (proficiency +3, to hit +6 with DEX); AC 16 (command breastplate & duelist agility), hit points 84 (13d8+26), speed 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the The Regal Lion article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>Byscilla Danos oversees the occupation and containment of Raventree Manor for the Iron Legion. Direct, brutally competent, and carrying the Corvinarus bloodline, she splits teams with chilling tactical precision and has zero tolerance for excuses.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> field commander & sorceress \u00b7 <strong>tier:</strong> Field Commander \u00b7 <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Manor Command.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/regal-lion/byscilla-danos.png</code> \u2014 NPC Forge render, seed 610001, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, polished steel and gold lion crest heraldry, dark navy blue and crimson surcoats, cold iron plate, flat colours, crisp shading. A sharp, severe human noblewoman in fitted charcoal-grey field armor with dark leather gloves, high leather collar, and swept-back silver-streaked hair. Cold piercing gaze, holding an elegant steel rapier at her side. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
